      "side": 1,
      "message": "As it seems `start` and `size` arrays need to be the same size, can this be made into its own child binding?  Something like `cros-ec,cbi-ufsc-field-segment`?",
      "revId": "48edb6eb1c95f3bed91d94aaf2970d7e6c81800a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "b8df34ed_98f75199",
        "filename": "zephyr/dts/bindings/cbi/cros-ec,cbi-ufsc.yaml",
        "patchSetId": 5
