      "lineNbr": 26,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000407
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-09-25T17:39:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, they need to be the same size. A BUILD_ASSERT in `cros_cbi_ufsc.c` guarantees that.\n\n```\n\tBUILD_ASSERT(DT_PROP_LEN(id, start) \u003d\u003d DT_PROP_LEN(id, size),         \\\n\t\t     \"UFSC start and size arrays must have same length\");     \\\n```",
      "parentUuid": "ff76c726_9c54b0f4",
      "revId": "48edb6eb1c95f3bed91d94aaf2970d7e6c81800a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e5f48cac_f53e27e6",
        "filename": "zephyr/dts/bindings/cbi/cros-ec,cbi-ufsc.yaml",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 26,
